{"seq":2,"slug":"llmops-genai-operations","title":"LLMOps 与 GenAI 运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/platform/llmops-genai-operations","wordCount":1187,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"llmops-与-genai-运维\">LLMOps 与 GenAI 运维</h1><p>大语言模型的生产运维不是&quot;MLOps 换了个模型&quot;——它是一个需要全新工具链和方法论的独立学科。当你的模型输出从&quot;0.87 的欺诈概率&quot;变成一段 500 token 的自然语言时，你之前所有关于监控、评估、版本管理的直觉都需要重新校准。2026 年，LLMOps 已从概念阶段进入工程化落地期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LLMOps 的独特性源于 LLM 的三个根本特征：<strong>输出非确定性</strong>（同一输入可能给出不同答案）、<strong>Prompt 是配置</strong>（改一句话就改变行为）、<strong>评估是主观的</strong>（没有单一数值能衡量&quot;回答质量&quot;）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Prompt 工程] --&gt; B[评估与测试]&#10;    B --&gt; C[部署与路由]&#10;    C --&gt; D[可观测性]&#10;    D --&gt; E[反馈收集]&#10;    E --&gt; A&#10;    F[安全护栏] --&gt; C&#10;    F --&gt; D&#10;    G[成本治理] --&gt; C&#10;    G --&gt; D&#10;    subgraph LLMOps 闭环&#10;        A&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[Prompt 工程] --&gt; B[评估与测试]\n    B --&gt; C[部署与路由]\n    C --&gt; D[可观测性]\n    D --&gt; E[反馈收集]\n    E --&gt; A\n    F[安全护栏] --&gt; C\n    F --&gt; D\n    G[成本治理] --&gt; C\n    G --&gt; D\n    subgraph LLMOps 闭环\n        A\n        B\n        C\n        D\n        E\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 MLOps</th>\n<th>LLMOps</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心产物</td>\n<td>训练好的模型权重</td>\n<td>Prompt 模板 + 模型版本 + RAG 配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估方式</td>\n<td>数值指标（accuracy/F1）</td>\n<td>LLM-as-Judge + 人工评审 + 多维评分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控焦点</td>\n<td>数据漂移/性能衰退</td>\n<td>输出质量/安全违规/幻觉检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本模型</td>\n<td>训练计算</td>\n<td>token 消耗（推理为主）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本管理</td>\n<td>模型版本</td>\n<td>Prompt 版本 + 模型版本 + 上下文版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要风险</td>\n<td>预测精度下降</td>\n<td>幻觉/Prompt 注入/信息泄露/偏见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚对象</td>\n<td>模型权重</td>\n<td>Prompt + 路由规则 + 护栏配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"prompt-版本化与注册中心\">Prompt 版本化与注册中心</h2><p>Prompt 在 LLM 应用中的地位等同于传统 ML 中的模型权重——它是决定系统行为的核心配置。必须像管理代码一样管理 Prompt。</p>\n<p><strong>MLflow 3 Prompt Registry：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import mlflow&#10;&#10;# 注册一个 Prompt 版本&#10;mlflow.genai.register_prompt(&#10;    name=&quot;fraud-analysis&quot;,&#10;    template=&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    Analyze the following transaction for potential fraud.&#10;    Transaction: {{transaction}}&#10;    Customer history: {{history}}&#10;    Respond with: risk_level, confidence, reasoning&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;,&#10;    tags={&quot;model&quot;: &quot;claude-3.5&quot;, &quot;use_case&quot;: &quot;fraud&quot;},&#10;)&#10;&#10;# A/B 测试不同 Prompt 版本&#10;mlflow.genai.set_prompt_routing(&#10;    name=&quot;fraud-analysis&quot;,&#10;    rules=[&#10;        {&quot;version&quot;: &quot;v3&quot;, &quot;traffic&quot;: 80},&#10;        {&quot;version&quot;: &quot;v4-candidate&quot;, &quot;traffic&quot;: 20},&#10;    ],&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mlflow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 注册一个 Prompt 版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mlflow.genai.register_prompt(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fraud-analysis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    template</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Analyze the following transaction for potential fraud.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Transaction: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Customer history: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">history</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Respond with: risk_level, confidence, reasoning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude-3.5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"use_case\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fraud\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># A/B 测试不同 Prompt 版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mlflow.genai.set_prompt_routing(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fraud-analysis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"traffic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v4-candidate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"traffic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Prompt 生命周期：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>活动</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发</td>\n<td>迭代编写、人工测试</td>\n<td>Playground/IDE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估</td>\n<td>自动评估 + LLM Judge</td>\n<td>MLflow Evaluate / Promptfoo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册</td>\n<td>版本化存入注册中心</td>\n<td>MLflow Prompt Registry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署</td>\n<td>A/B 测试、渐进发布</td>\n<td>路由层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控</td>\n<td>质量追踪、成本计量</td>\n<td>Tracing + 仪表盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退役</td>\n<td>标记废弃、流量归零</td>\n<td>注册中心状态管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"评估体系-llm-as-judge\">评估体系：LLM-as-Judge</h2><p>传统 ML 有明确的标签和数值指标；LLM 输出的评估则需要多维度、主观性更强的方法。</p>\n<p><strong>三层评估架构：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>确定性评估</strong>：格式检查、JSON 解析成功率、长度约束、禁止词过滤</li>\n<li><strong>LLM-as-Judge</strong>：用另一个 LLM 对输出做多维评分（相关性/准确性/安全性/流畅度）</li>\n<li><strong>人工评审</strong>：领域专家在 Review Queue 中做金标准标注</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# MLflow 3.14 的评估流水线&#10;results = mlflow.genai.evaluate(&#10;    model=&quot;models:/fraud-analyst/production&quot;,&#10;    data=golden_dataset,&#10;    evaluators=[&#10;        &quot;mlflow.metrics.genai.relevance&quot;,&#10;        &quot;mlflow.metrics.genai.faithfulness&quot;,&#10;        &quot;mlflow.metrics.genai.safety&quot;,&#10;    ],&#10;    judge_model=&quot;claude-3.5-sonnet&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;# CI 门控&#10;assert results.metrics[&quot;safety/mean&quot;] &gt;= 0.95&#10;assert results.metrics[&quot;faithfulness/mean&quot;] &gt;= 0.85\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># MLflow 3.14 的评估流水线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mlflow.genai.evaluate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"models:/fraud-analyst/production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">golden_dataset,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    evaluators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"mlflow.metrics.genai.relevance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"mlflow.metrics.genai.faithfulness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"mlflow.metrics.genai.safety\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    judge_model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude-3.5-sonnet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 门控</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.metrics[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"safety/mean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.95</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.metrics[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"faithfulness/mean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.85</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"可观测性-端到端-tracing\">可观测性：端到端 Tracing</h2><p>LLM 应用的调试比传统 ML 困难得多——一个错误回答可能源于 Prompt 问题、检索失败、上下文窗口溢出或模型幻觉。端到端 tracing 是定位问题的唯一手段。</p>\n<p><strong>典型 trace 结构：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户输入] --&gt; B[Prompt 模板渲染]&#10;    B --&gt; C[RAG 检索]&#10;    C --&gt; D[上下文组装]&#10;    D --&gt; E[LLM 调用]&#10;    E --&gt; F[输出解析]&#10;    F --&gt; G[护栏检查]&#10;    G --&gt; H[返回用户]\">graph LR\n    A[用户输入] --&gt; B[Prompt 模板渲染]\n    B --&gt; C[RAG 检索]\n    C --&gt; D[上下文组装]\n    D --&gt; E[LLM 调用]\n    E --&gt; F[输出解析]\n    F --&gt; G[护栏检查]\n    G --&gt; H[返回用户]</pre><p>每个节点记录：输入/输出、延迟、token 消耗、模型版本、Prompt 版本。异常节点自动标记。</p>\n<p><strong>2026 主流 Tracing 方案：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>核心优势</th>\n<th>集成度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MLflow Tracing</td>\n<td>统一平台</td>\n<td>与 MLflow 生态无缝</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LangSmith</td>\n<td>LangChain 原生</td>\n<td>调试体验最佳</td>\n<td>LangChain 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Langfuse</td>\n<td>开源替代</td>\n<td>自托管 + 灵活</td>\n<td>广泛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>W&amp;B Weave</td>\n<td>实验追踪延伸</td>\n<td>实验→生产一体</td>\n<td>W&amp;B 生态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"安全护栏\">安全护栏</h2><p>LLM 的安全风险与传统模型完全不同——Prompt 注入、信息泄露、有害内容生成是 LLM 特有的威胁。</p>\n<p><strong>护栏层次：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>输入护栏</strong>：检测 Prompt 注入、过滤敏感信息、限制输入长度</li>\n<li><strong>输出护栏</strong>：内容安全检查、格式验证、幻觉检测、PII 脱敏</li>\n<li><strong>系统护栏</strong>：速率限制、token 预算、并发控制</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>MLflow 3.14 Gateway 护栏（2026 新增）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Gateway 端点配置&#10;endpoints:&#10;  - name: fraud-analysis&#10;    model: claude-3.5-sonnet&#10;    guardrails:&#10;      input:&#10;        - type: prompt_injection_detection&#10;          action: block&#10;        - type: pii_detection&#10;          action: redact&#10;      output:&#10;        - type: content_safety&#10;          threshold: 0.9&#10;          action: block&#10;      budget:&#10;        max_tokens_per_minute: 100000&#10;        max_cost_per_day: 500\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Gateway 端点配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">endpoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fraud-analysis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">claude-3.5-sonnet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    guardrails</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prompt_injection_detection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">block</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pii_detection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">content_safety</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          threshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">block</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      budget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        max_tokens_per_minute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        max_cost_per_day</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"成本治理与路由优化\">成本治理与路由优化</h2><p>LLM 推理的 token 成本是传统 ML 没有的新挑战。一个每天处理 100 万请求的 LLM 服务可能月成本超过 10 万美元。</p>\n<p><strong>成本优化策略：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>节省幅度</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>质量影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Prompt 压缩</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>需验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型路由（大小模型混用）</td>\n<td>30-60%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存命中（相似请求复用）</td>\n<td>10-50%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量聚合</td>\n<td>10-20%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自托管小模型替代 API</td>\n<td>50-80%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>智能路由架构：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>简单查询（事实查询/格式转换）→ 小模型（如 GPT-4o-mini / Claude Haiku）</li>\n<li>复杂推理（分析/创作/多步推理）→ 大模型（如 GPT-4o / Claude Sonnet）</li>\n<li>判断模型 → 轻量分类器决定路由</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LLMOps 是独立学科，核心差异在于非确定性输出、Prompt 即配置、主观评估</li>\n<li>Prompt 版本化和注册中心是 LLMOps 的基石</li>\n<li>评估体系 = 确定性检查 + LLM-as-Judge + 人工评审三层</li>\n<li>端到端 tracing 是 LLM 应用调试的唯一可靠手段</li>\n<li>安全护栏和成本治理是生产级 LLM 的必备能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../data-drift-model-monitoring/detection/embedding-drift\">数据漂移与监控：嵌入漂移</a> — LLM 输出质量监控的漂移检测方法</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/evaluation-foundations/why-evals-matter\">LLM 应用评估：评估基础</a> — GenAI 评估体系的完整框架</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LLMOps 与 GenAI 运维","id":"llmops-与-genai-运维"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Prompt 版本化与注册中心","id":"prompt-版本化与注册中心"},{"level":2,"text":"评估体系：LLM-as-Judge","id":"评估体系-llm-as-judge"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性：端到端 Tracing","id":"可观测性-端到端-tracing"},{"level":2,"text":"安全护栏","id":"安全护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"成本治理与路由优化","id":"成本治理与路由优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"企业内部 ML 平台设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/platform/internal-ml-platform"},"next":{"title":"治理合规与成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/platform/governance-compliance"}}